              <label class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer bg-slate-900/50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-800"><input type="checkbox" id="perm_orga_delete_item" class="accent-amber-500 rounded" /> 🗑️ Items löschen</label>
